      {
        "name": "places/ChIJJfw2BigBBDQR5PgAwJEv_Xw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t4TlMwRlJUalJwT1hOcVR6RTBZalphUlVWeWJrRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "☕️ 土瓜灣的隱藏寶藏：John Choy Cafe 的平價虹吸咖啡\n\n在 Threads 上偶然滑到這間土瓜灣街坊咖啡店，才發現原來香港還有這樣的驚喜。虹吸咖啡在香港並不常見，更難得的是價錢如此親民。店舖沒有華麗的裝潢，反而像街坊餐廳般親切。豆單有兩頁，選擇豐富，我點的虹吸咖啡只要 $70，讓我驚訝不已。\n\n當天還加了一個雙拼三文治，$35，即叫即做，麵包烘得香脆，味道也很合格。咖啡加三文治總共 $105，這樣的價位在香港幾乎絕無僅有，堪稱民間隱藏的寶藏。\n\nI came across this neighborhood café in To Kwa Wan while scrolling Threads, and it really surprised me. Siphon coffee isn’t common in Hong Kong, and finding it at such a friendly price is even rarer. The place doesn’t have fancy décor, it feels more like a local eatery. The coffee bean menu has two full pages, lots of choices, and the prices are much cheaper than most siphon coffee shops. The cup I ordered was only $70, which amazed me.\n\nI also got a double sandwich for $35. It was made fresh, the bread nicely toasted, and the taste was solid. Coffee plus sandwich came to just $105. A deal that’s almost impossible to find in Hong Kong. Truly a hidden gem in the neighborhood.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "☕️ 土瓜灣的隱藏寶藏：John Choy Cafe 的平價虹吸咖啡\n\n在 Threads 上偶然滑到這間土瓜灣街坊咖啡店，才發現原來香港還有這樣的驚喜。虹吸咖啡在香港並不常見，更難得的是價錢如此親民。店舖沒有華麗的裝潢，反而像街坊餐廳般親切。豆單有兩頁，選擇豐富，我點的虹吸咖啡只要 $70，讓我驚訝不已。\n\n當天還加了一個雙拼三文治，$35，即叫即做，麵包烘得香脆，味道也很合格。咖啡加三文治總共 $105，這樣的價位在香港幾乎絕無僅有，堪稱民間隱藏的寶藏。\n\nI came across this neighborhood café in To Kwa Wan while scrolling Threads, and it really surprised me. Siphon coffee isn’t common in Hong Kong, and finding it at such a friendly price is even rarer. The place doesn’t have fancy décor, it feels more like a local eatery. The coffee bean menu has two full pages, lots of choices, and the prices are much cheaper than most siphon coffee shops. The cup I ordered was only $70, which amazed me.\n\nI also got a double sandwich for $35. It was made fresh, the bread nicely toasted, and the taste was solid. Coffee plus sandwich came to just $105. A deal that’s almost impossible to find in Hong Kong. Truly a hidden gem in the neighborhood.",
